      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6427779::rubric_card::000::cafce92f87"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing at 900 °C for 5 minutes after SLM will stabilize the microstructure.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processing route will produce an ultrafine-grained BCC/FCC dual-phase microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_card::000::8d31f456a8"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature exposure will produce a dense, continuous protective surface layer of Al2O3 and Cr2O3.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Submicron grain refinement will increase hardness through Hall–Petch strengthening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A high grain-boundary density will accelerate outward diffusion of Al and Cr and thereby promote protective oxide formation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ultrafine grain refinement will decelerate high-temperature oxidation kinetics.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_card::000::8d31f456a8"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine grains and Cr will accelerate passive-film formation in 3.5 wt% NaCl and reduce corrosion current density.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ti or additional Cr will enhance lattice distortion and solid-solution strengthening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed alloy will have a microhardness above 750 HV.",
